cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "sdash: a local-first web dashboard for Slurm clusters"
abstract: >-
  A dashboard for Slurm clusters that each user runs on their own machine:
  one Go binary with an embedded web interface that listens on loopback and
  talks HTTP to the slurmrestd a site already runs, directly or through SSH,
  under the user's own Slurm identity.
